  "description": "<p data-start=\"319\" data-end=\"560\">De iconische <strong data-start=\"332\" data-end=\"362\">Bang & Olufsen BeoLab 8000</strong> is één van de meest herkenbare en geliefde actieve luidsprekers ooit gemaakt. Deze set in <strong data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"470\">Zilver/Silver</strong> staat bekend om zijn slanke, elegante design en indrukwekkend helder, dynamisch geluid.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"562\" data-end=\"777\">Dit exemplaar verkeert <strong data-start=\"585\" data-end=\"603\">In Nette Staat</strong>: lichte gebruikssporen mogelijk, maar volledig getest en 100% functioneel. Perfect voor wie B&O-kwaliteit wil combineren met design dat in elk interieur tot zijn recht komt.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"779\" data-end=\"796\">⭐ Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"1120\">\r\n<li data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"856\">\r\n<p data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"856\">🔊 <strong data-start=\"802\" data-end=\"822\">Actieve speakers</strong> – geen externe versterker nodig</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"913\">\r\n<p data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"913\">🎶 Eigentijdse, heldere en krachtige geluidsweergave</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"965\">\r\n<p data-start=\"916\" data-end=\"965\">🏆 Iconisch B&O-design: slank, hoog en tijdloos</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"966\" data-end=\"1015\">\r\n<p data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1015\">🛠️ Hoge bouwkwaliteit en duurzame materialen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1077\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1077\">🔌 Eenvoudig aan te sluiten op TV, streamer of versterker</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1120\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1120\">✔️ 100% getest en volledig functioneel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1122\" data-end=\"1125\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1149\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1737\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1191\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1152\" data-end=\"1191\"><strong data-start=\"1152\" data-end=\"1162\">Model:</strong> Bang & Olufsen BeoLab 8000</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1228\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1228\"><strong data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1203\">Type:</strong> Actieve luidsprekerset</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1258\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1258\"><strong data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1241\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1289\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1289\"><strong data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1271\">Kleur:</strong> Zilver / Silver</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1350\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1350\"><strong data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1305\">Vermogen:</strong> 2× 125W Class AB versterking (per speaker)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1395\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1395\"><strong data-start=\"1353\" data-end=\"1368\">Aansturing:</strong> Line-in (RCA), Powerlink</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1471\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1471\"><strong data-start=\"1398\" data-end=\"1419\">Frequentiebereik:</strong> Breed en gedetailleerd, geschikt voor muziek & TV</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1549\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1488\"><strong data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1486\">Drivers:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1549\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1517\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1493\" data-end=\"1517\">2× woofers per speaker</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1549\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1549\">Geïntegreerde versterkers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1612\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1612\"><strong data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1564\">Gebruik:</strong> Woonkamer • HiFi • TV-audio • Muziekstreaming</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1613\" data-end=\"1737\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1737\"><strong data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1631\">Meegeleverd:</strong><br data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1634\">✔ Speakerset BeoLab 8000<br data-start=\"1660\" data-end=\"1663\"><em data-start=\"1665\" data-end=\"1737\">(Eventuele kabels / voeten / accessoires voeg ik toe indien aanwezig.)</em></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1742\">\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1744\" data-end=\"1777\"><strong data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1767\">Incl. Garantie:</strong> 1 maand</h3>",
